{"id":"ee412a4609cb21e2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sigma2-domination-collapse.md","title":"可计算支配使 Σ₂ 集合降为 c.e.","display":"thm-sigma2-domination-collapse — 可计算支配使 Σ₂ 集合降为 c.e.","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sigma2-domination-collapse","aliases":["20-thm-sigma2-domination-collapse"],"display":"thm-sigma2-domination-collapse — 可计算支配使 Σ₂ 集合降为 c.e.","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.11","source_printed_pages":[127],"source_pdf_pages":[162],"depends_on":["[[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]","[[20-df-domination]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sigma2-domination-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sigma2-domination-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma2-domination-collapse — 可计算支配使 Σ₂ 集合降为 c.e."},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>162</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"296494bb2dbabc67\" href=\"?note=296494bb2dbabc67\" title=\"20-df-sigma2-approximation\">20-df-sigma2-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(g:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{a,A}^{\\Sigma_2}\\le^*g\">\\(c_{a,A}^{\\Sigma_2}\\le^*g\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"296494bb2dbabc67\" href=\"?note=296494bb2dbabc67\" title=\"20-df-sigma2-approximation\">20-df-sigma2-approximation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma2-domination-collapse}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal E^{\\operatorname{graph}(g)}\\quad\\land\\quad[g\\text{ 全可计算}\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal E].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma2-domination-collapse}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal E^{\\operatorname{graph}(g)}\\quad\\land\\quad[g\\text{ 全可计算}\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal E].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限修补 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 使它处处不小于计算函数和输入。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y&gt;x\">\\(y&gt;x\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x,t)=1\">\\(a(x,t)=1\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le t\\le g(y)\">\\(y\\le t\\le g(y)\\)</span> 都成立。成员在足够晚时全部为 1；非成员在每个这样的 frame 都有 0。右侧是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 可枚举的有限见证搜索。不能把结论加强成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.11；印刷页 127；PDF 第 162 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-sigma2-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"296494bb2dbabc67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma2-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"296494bb2dbabc67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma2-approximation]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sigma2Approx}(a,A)","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c_{a,A}^{\\Sigma_2}\\le^*g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma2-domination-collapse}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal E^{\\operatorname{graph}(g)}\\quad\\land\\quad[g\\text{ 全可计算}\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal E].","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"y>x","display":false},{"tex":"a(x,t)=1","display":false},{"tex":"y\\le t\\le g(y)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1473,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["296494bb2dbabc67","2e0726b34b0b1c40","2c15e9656c322806"]}